port the UW Food Science Department’s mission of research, teaching and outreach. Most know Babcock Hall for its ice cream, but the plant also produces award-winning cheeses and bottles locally produced milk. Please stop by the Dairy Store at 1605 Linden Drive in Madison, WI, to enjoy our dairy specialties as well as breakfast and lunch items. Hours Menu Website Payment options Cash Flex Dining Plan","links":[{"label":"Hours","url":"http://babcockhalldairystore.wisc.edu"},{"label":"Menu","url":"http://babcockhalldairystore.wisc.edu/menu/"},{"label":"Website","url":"http://babcockhalldairystore.wisc.edu"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_39","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/345.html"},{"id":"129f37ec-9dc5-5b0e-8f3a-69b70d6e8247","uw_map_object_id":"347","category":"departments","name":"Barnard Hall (Chadbourne front desk)","description":"Barnard Hall (Chadbourne front desk)","links":[{"label":"Barnard Hall (Chadbourne front desk)","url":"https://www.housing.wisc.edu/undergraduate/services/desks/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/347.html"},{"id":"66a50cfd-3d2a-591c-bbc3-c50b8335840e","uw_map_object_id":"348","category":"departments","name":"Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Coordinator","description":"Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Coordinator","links":[{"label":"Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) Coordinator","url":"https://compliance.wisc.edu/ada/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/348.html"},{"id":"f1af49a8-5cde-5f97-8142-efc1395a846e","uw_map_object_id":"348","category":"departments","name":"Chancellor's Office","description":"Chancellor's Office","links":[{"label":"Chancellor's Office","url":"https://chancellor.wisc.edu"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/348.html"},{"id":"2020b421-a641-595c-bd51-a410b9011154","uw_map_object_id":"348","category":"departments","name":"Compliance, Office of","descri