 - Made-to-order breakfast, lunch and dinner items. Waubesa Wok - Freshly prepared, made-to-order Asian cuisine.Around the World - Different ethnic cuisine featured for one to two weeks at a time. Four Lakes Favorites - Comfort foodsBascom Hill Bakery - Muffins, bars, cookies, pastries, hot cobbler and bread puddingBig Ham on Campus - Hot and cold made-to-order sandwichesFarmer's Market - Salad bar (make your own or order one to go) and hot hor d'oeuvres (chicken wings, fried cheese curds and jalapeno poppers) are also available.Milk Shakes - A self-service milk shake machine capable of making nine different flavors of shakes. Hours Website","links":[{"label":"Hours","url":"http://www.uwhealth.org/patient-guides/uw-hospital/cafeteria-and-dining/10158"},{"label":"Website","url":"http://www.uwhealth.org/patient-guides/uw-hospital/cafeteria-and-dining/10158"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_5","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/364.html"},{"id":"9ba0d4bb-e1df-5d6b-a30b-5d70555b9526","uw_map_object_id":"364","category":"dining","name":"Java Coast","description":"View full-size image of Java Coast For a coffee shop atmosphere, stop by the Java Coast for lattes, hot and iced cappuccino and other specialties. Located on the second floor in the Clinics Lobby of UW Hospital. Hours Website","links":[{"label":"Hours","url":"https://www.uwhealth.org/locations/university-hospital-170"},{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.uwhealth.org/locations/university-hospital-170"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_44","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/364.html"},{"id":"a92bd3d4-757e-5a90-9c92-8084d0bff412","uw_map_object_id":"364","category":"dining","name":"Mendota Market","description":"View full-size image of Mendota Market The Mendota Market is the hospital's convenience store, located on the first floor near the cafeteria. It features Starbucks coffee, Babcock Hall ice cream, pizza, calzones, and a deli counter. Groceries and convenience store