/union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/southcantina/"},{"label":"Menu","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/southcantina/#restaurant-menus"},{"label":"Website","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/southcantina/"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_27","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/647.html"},{"id":"fc60c47c-e82e-5daa-ae34-13159f8fe289","uw_map_object_id":"647","category":"dining","name":"The Sett Pub","description":"View full-size image of The Sett Pub The Sett Pub boasts a large menu with classic pub fare, accented by a rare tap list. The Sett Pub is a place to gather on game days, or relax and enjoy some live entertainment. Take your food upstairs for some extra seating to overlook the stage! Hours Menu Website Payment options Apple Pay Cash Credit Card Google Pay Wiscard Flex Dining Plan Union Gift Card","links":[{"label":"Hours","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/the-sett/"},{"label":"Menu","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/the-sett/#restaurant-menus"},{"label":"Website","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/dine/find-food-and-drink/the-sett/"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_32","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/647.html"},{"id":"d192e041-c39e-5ea9-b0db-efafe016bff2","uw_map_object_id":"647","category":"infolabs","name":"Union South InfoLab (Computer Lab Only)","description":"Address: 1220 Linden Dr. Madison WI 53706 Phone: 608-890-3000 Hours: 7 a.m.–8 p.m. [More info] Visit website","links":[{"label":"More info","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/visit/hours/"},{"label":"Visit website","url":"https://union.wisc.edu/visit/hours/"}],"source_item_id":"details_infolab_102","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/647.html"},{"id":"bbd9c6be-3d39-5d1c-8bb4-17fcacbed23c","uw_map_object_id":"648","category":"departments","name":"Morgridge Institute for Research","description":"Morgridge Institute for Research","links":[{"label":"Morgridge Institute for Research","url":"https://morgridge.org/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/648.html"},{"id":"5c607da1-3750-546e-9d67-5248cfc6d5b4","uw_map_object_id":"648","category":"departments","name":"Wisconsin Institute for Discovery","description":"Wisconsin Institute for Discovery","links":[{"label":"Wisconsin Institute for Discovery","url":"https://wid.wisc.edu/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/648.html"},{"id":"5db1c4e6-4951-5a25-80ec-1e7b147f52e7","uw_map_object_id":"648","category":"dining","name":"Aldo’s Cafe","description":"View full-size image of Aldo’s Cafe A bright and open space, Aldo’s Cafe is a UW campus favorite. Serving fairtrade organic coffee roasted right here in Madison. It’s a great spot for a quick breakfast or lunch with local flare. In a hurry? Need to grab a bite before your next class or meeting? Aldo's Cafe has great Grab and Go options that are always at the ready, or you can also SKIP THE LINE and order online! In addition to cash, credit card and Apple Pay, Aldo’s also accepts the Red Card and Food Fight gift cards. Hours Menu Website Payment options Apple Pay Cash Credit Card","links":[{"label":"order online","url":"https://www.aldoscafemadison.com/order-online/"},{"label":"Hours","url":"https://www.aldoscafemadison.com/"},{"label":"Menu","url":"https://www.aldoscafemadison.com/menus/"},{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.aldoscafemadison.com/"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_41","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/648.html"},{"id":"a7947b11-d750-54c5-9a40-6319a76681b1","uw_map_object_id":"648","category":"dining","name":"Steenbock’s on Orchard","description":"View full-size image of Steenbock’s on Orchard Steenbock’s on Orchard is located in the Discovery Building, a vibrant gathering place and research center, and a must-stop for those looking for lunch, an after-work glass of wine, or a stylish dinner in a world-class setting. Featuring sleek, modern decor, floor-to-ceiling windows, and a folding glass wall that opens to a covered, outdoor dining area, Steenbock’s is a one-of-a-kind destination. The space includes a large bar with attached dining room, a second, separate dining room, and a small private room. The unique layout makes Steenbock’s a convivial yet intimate setting that appeals to locals, visitors, and business professionals; a great space for groups large and small—all of the spaces may be rented out for private events. In addition to cash and credit cards, Steenbock’s also accepts Food Fight gift cards. Hours Menu Website Payment options Cash Credit Card","links":[{"label":"Hours","url":"https://www.steenbocksonorchard.com/"},{"label":"Menu","url":"https://www.steenbocksonorchard.com/menus/"},{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.steenbocksonorchard.com/"}],"source_item_id":"details_dining_42","source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/648.html"},{"id":"c174877e-7f4b-5ac8-8b58-45e4cca2e734","uw_map_object_id":"649","category":"departments","name":"Connections Program","description":"Connections Program","links":[{"label":"Connections Program","url":"https://admissions.wisc.edu/connections/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/649.html"},{"id":"1d2acfe1-2f14-5e7a-944d-c608f9bcaefd","uw_map_object_id":"649","category":"departments","name":"McBurney Disability Resource Center","description":"McBurney Disability Resource Center","links":[{"label":"McBurney Disability Resource Center","url":"https://mcburney.wisc.edu/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":"https://map.wisc.edu/api/v1/map_objects/649.html"},{"id":"ffe706d7-a08b-5c52-b9c7-919e02153e0f","uw_map_object_id":"649","category":"departments","name":"Office of Admissions and Recruitment","description":"Office of Admissions and Recruitment","links":[{"label":"Office of Admissions and Recruitment","url":"https://admissions.wisc.edu/"}],"source_item_id":null,"source_url":